       "w": 911,
       "h": 175,
       "kind": "text",
       "tag": "p",
       "text": "**Furscape is my solo design and developed game on Unreal Engine 5. The game is based on an abandoned puppy in a forest named Chunnu, a challenge awaits for the player as they need to unveil their way through the forest avoiding obstacles and plan their escape. The idea for the entire project was inspired by a real life incident. **",
