        "lh": 1.2
       },
       "mt": 2,
       "dx": 149
      },
      {
       "w": 495,
       "h": 275,
       "kind": "text",
       "tag": "p",
       "text": "**Furscape** is inspired by a real incident where my girlfriend and I rescued abandoned puppies after a trek. We cared for them and asked local kids to look after them, but after heavy rains one puppy fell sick and was left alone at a nearby farm. That moment sparked my passion for helping animals and became the emotional core of this game.\nThe story follows a lone puppy as she navigates and escapes the forest, avoiding traps and obstacles along the way.",
       "font": {
        "f": "dm",
        "s": 18.0,
        "w": 400,
        "c": "fg",
        "lh": 1.7
       },
       "mt": 9,
